{"id":"n61162-1-7","stage":3,"title":"뽀뽀 · 亲亲","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61162-1-7-1","ko":"너희 조카 정말 귀엽다.","zh":"你们的侄子真可爱。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조카","meaning":"侄子，侄儿，侄女","explanation":"조카：侄子，侄儿，侄女","readings":[{"term":"조카","audio":"/audio/f468453f8bc9c337dd97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91753","senseId":"1","lemma":"조카","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"귀엽다.","meaning":"可爱","explanation":"귀엽다：可爱；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"귀엽다","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38323","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀엽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"f468453f8bc9c337","term":"조카","zh":"侄子，侄儿，侄女","audio":"/audio/f468453f8bc9c337dd97.mp3","entryId":"91753","definition":"兄弟姐妹生的孩子。","pronunciation":["조카"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f6866c147cb407d9","term":"귀엽다","zh":"可爱","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3","entryId":"38323","definition":"看起来漂亮，或令人喜爱。","pronunciation":["귀ː엽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3a47de6f1c0358e25871.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61162-1-7-2","ko":"그렇지? 보고 있으면 예뻐서 뽀뽀를 안 할 수가 없어.","zh":"对吧？一看就觉得太漂亮了，忍不住想亲一口。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇지?","meaning":"是呀，就是","explanation":"그렇지：是呀，就是","readings":[{"term":"그렇지","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26031","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보고","meaning":"看样子，看来","explanation":"보다：看样子，看来；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으면","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예뻐서","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뽀뽀를","meaning":"亲亲","explanation":"뽀뽀：亲亲；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"뽀뽀","audio":"/audio/fb908c093a783716fdd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61162","senseId":"1","lemma":"뽀뽀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"66da57bd505cc1e1","term":"그렇지","zh":"是呀，就是","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3","entryId":"26031","definition":"某个事实与自己所想的一致时，以感叹的语气所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러치"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看样子，看来","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"由前面的话语所指的行动或状态来推算或表示即使不正确但知道。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"fb908c093a783716","term":"뽀뽀","zh":"亲亲","audio":"/audio/fb908c093a783716fdd8.mp3","entryId":"61162","definition":"在身体的一部分贴上嘴唇；或指那种事情。","pronunciation":["뽀뽀"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e15354003e255ea04943.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.925,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61162","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语